THIRD-PARTY COMPONENTS

app/src/main/assets/models/yolov8m_seg_int8.tflite
    YOLOv8m-seg by Ultralytics, licensed under AGPL-3.0 (https://github.com/ultralytics/ultralytics).
    Exported with Ultralytics' own TFLite exporter, int8-quantized:
        from ultralytics import YOLO
        YOLO("yolov8m-seg.pt").export(format="tflite", int8=True, data="coco128-seg.yaml")

app/src/main/assets/models/depth_anything_v2_small_wi8.tflite
    Depth Anything V2 Small (https://huggingface.co/depth-anything/Depth-Anything-V2-Small),
    licensed under Apache-2.0. Taken from Qualcomm AI Hub's float TFLite export
    (https://huggingface.co/qualcomm/Depth-Anything-V2, release v0.66.0), then weight-only
    int8-quantized with Google's ai-edge-quantizer:
        from ai_edge_quantizer import quantizer, recipe
        q = quantizer.Quantizer("depth_anything_v2.tflite")
        q.load_quantization_recipe(recipe.dynamic_wi8_afp32())
        q.quantize().export_model("depth_anything_v2_small_wi8.tflite")

